      "note": "IAM-1201: resource family accepted with its explicit attached-resource context and routed to the resource evaluator (never identity rules). Service-specific resource finding rules are foundational (IAM-1202..1206), so the analysis is INCOMPLETE: not blocked, zero findings, and explicitly not proven-safe."
    },
